      en: "St. Andrew's Kirk in Georgetown is a Presbyterian church built in 1818. It is one of the oldest churches in Guyana. The brick and timber building features Georgian architecture. The church survived several fires and has been restored. It still serves as a place of worship. The congregation has a long history.",
